{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42001","headline":"维舟秋浦逢故人张矩同泊 · 李中","name":"维舟秋浦逢故人张矩同泊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卸帆清夜碧江滨，冉冉凉风动白苹。\n波上正吟新霁月，岸头恰见故乡人。\n共惊别後霜侵鬓，互说年来疾逼身。\n且饮一壶销百恨，会须遭遇识通津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42001.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42001","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}